# Hardened SSH settings for a Brasaland server.
# Demonstrated in a Docker container (see infra/hardening/Dockerfile).
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 30
AllowUsers deploy
UsePAM yes
PrintMotd no
